@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #365879
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EEF4F8
hide empty members
title U07 类图：Memento与隔离历史重放
class World <<Originator>> {
  -agents
  -locations
  -actions
  +create_memento(): WorldMemento
  {static} +from_memento(m, read_only): World
  +apply_event(event)
}
class WorldMemento <<Memento>> {
  +run_id: str
  +seq: int
  +sim_time_ms: int
  +schema_version: int
  +hash: str
  -opaque_state
}
class SnapshotStore <<Caretaker>> {
  +save(memento)
  +load_nearest(run_id, seq): WorldMemento
}
class ReplayService <<Caretaker>> {
  +state_at(run_id, seq): ReadOnlyView
}
class EventStore {
  +between(run_id, from_seq, to_seq): DomainEvent[]
}
class ReadOnlyView
World ..> WorldMemento : 创建/解释内部状态
SnapshotStore o-- "0..*" WorldMemento : 保管，不解释
ReplayService --> SnapshotStore
ReplayService --> EventStore
ReplayService ..> World : 新建隔离对象，应用历史事件
ReplayService ..> ReadOnlyView : 返回
note bottom of ReplayService
无ModelGateway或CommandProcessor依赖。
不能覆盖生产中的World状态。
只还原过去，不生成历史分支。
end note
@enduml
